    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moran Auctioneers are delighted to present to the Market this exceptional detached 4/5-bedroom residence, superbly positioned just 2 miles from Castlebar Town Centre on the highly sought-after Turlough Road. Nestled in a serene and peaceful setting, this impressive home enjoys the perfect balance of privacy and convenience. Set on a generous site with mature landscaped gardens and beautiful countryside views, the property offers an idyllic setting for family living while remaining within easy reach of every essential amenity. The location is truly exceptional, with the renowned greenway on the doorstep and the national museum of ireland – Country Life just a short drive away. castlebar town centre is only minutes from the property, providing an excellent range of Shops, Schools, Restaurants and Leisure Amenities, while Ireland West Knock Airport is approximately a 35-minute drive, making this an ideal location for both Commuters and those seeking a tranquil lifestyle.\r\nInternally, the residence offers beautifully proportioned, elegant, light-filled accommodation with spacious living areas designed for modern family living.this outstanding home successfully combines the tranquillity of a countryside setting with the convenience of town living, making it a rare opportunity in one of Castlebar's most desirable residential locations.\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, setting and exceptional lifestyle this superb home has to offer in one of Castlebar’s most desirable residential locations\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, setting and exceptional lifestyle this superb home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The Accommodation comprises:-\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: (10`4”x 10`) With large feature picture Windows. Oak Flooring.\r\nDouble Doors to :\r\nHallway/ Cloakroom: (12`1”x 9`7”) With oak flooring.\r\nSitting Room:(13`6” x 22`2”) With grey painted fireplace , oak floorin. Large Window loverlooking the front garden with views of the Countryside.Patio Door to side. Coving throughout.\r\nHallway: (28`x 5`) + (21`2”x 2`8”) With clothes Closet.\r\nKitchen: (13`6”x 13`) With fuel range of oak units to include Appliances. Tiled floor.\r\nDoor Window to Dining Room: (17`8”x 13`7” With oil fired Stove , feature stone fireplace. Pine flooring.Timber cladding ceiling with recessed lighting. and 2 Velux Windows.\r\nUtility Room: (7`8”x 6`) With tiled floor. Fully plumbed.\r\nStudy/ Office/\r\nBedroom:(15`6”x 11`3”) With built in units and shelving. Patio Door to front.\r\nMain Bathroom: (8`x 5`7”) With white suite , Velux Window. Shower over Bath . Tiled walls and floor.\r\nBedroom(1):(9`x 17`8”)+(8`3”x 8`6”) With built in units and pine flooring. Large Window overlooking the back Garden. Recessed lighting.\r\nBedroom(2): (13`x 11`8”)With limed oak flooring.\r\nEnsuite: (5`7”x 3`7”) With electric Shower , fully tiled walls and floor. White Suite.\r\nBedroom(3): (9`3”x 11`7”) With white built in units , pine flooring. Overlooking the front garden.\r\nStairs to Landing: (9`x 8`4”) Door top of landing leads to Storage.\r\nBedroom(4):(10`2”x 5`7”x 11`4”x 16`4”) With built in units and 2 Large Velux Windows with 3 feature Windows .Overlooking the back garden.\r\nEnsuite: (6`7”x 5`8”) With Power Shower and tiled walls and floor.\r\nShed\r\nBoiler House.\r\nPrivate Rear Garden with garden and tarmac drive to the front.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
